# Generated at build time by scripts/site-export-*.mjs, from the rule sources,
# the fixer registry, samples/ and the GitHub Releases API. Not committed, for
# the same reason the site does not hand-write any number: a checked-in copy is
# a snapshot that stops matching the product on the next release, and nothing
# would report the divergence.
#
# Consequence, on purpose: `npm run build` in this directory does not work on a
# fresh clone until the generators have run. See site/README.md.
src/data/

# Snippets are derived from samples/ with the rule-naming trailing comments
# stripped, then run through the CLI. Same rule as above.
demo/

# Astro's dev-server cache.
.astro/
